Sign-in uses Codex's public OAuth client the way Codex (https://github.com/openai/codex, Apache-2.0) and
Hermes Agent (https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent, MIT) do. Requests identify themselves as
Symbolon. No code from either project is included.

Model metadata comes at runtime from the signed-in account's catalog, or from Codex's models.json when
that is unavailable. Neither is bundled.
